// KAN-215. Every icon name the extension can render, as a closed set.
//
// The icon font ships inside the extension as a SUBSET containing only these
// ligatures (src/assets/fonts/, regenerated by `npm run fonts:fetch`), about
// 5 KB instead of the full 344 KB. A ligature missing from the subset does not
// render tofu -- it renders its NAME as text, the failure KAN-215 measured
// offline. So the set has to be exactly what the code uses, and a grep cannot
// produce it: names arrive through ternaries, template literals and props.
//
// Hence a type rather than a list to remember. Icon's `type`, Button's
// `iconType` and OverflowMenu's icons all take an IconName, so using a name
// that is not here fails `tsc`. Adding one here without rerunning the fetch
// fails e2e/icon-font-subset.spec.ts, which draws every entry with the bundled
// font.

/** Drawn by the bundled Material Symbols subset. Keep sorted. */
